4A/t0/h001.q9qJ3aqH_6hxSTkdkytpWHZPbGEbzS25KsFuDFw_BeA
Northern Ireland Women=E2=80=99s
manager.

After laying the foundations at Falkirk, St Mirren and Ayr United, a spell =
coaching Scotland Women=E2=80=99s Under-23 side and a role with the Scottis=
h FA as the head of elite women=E2=80=99s football led to his appointment b=
y Northern Ireland in March.


