<td valign=3D"top"><span style=3D"font-size:24px;font-style:italic;font-fam=
ily:Georgia, serif;font-weight:400;line-height:140%;color:#0077B6">Jonathan=
 Wilson</span></td>
<td width=3D"110" height=3D"90" style=3D"line-height:0;font-size:0"><img sr=
c=3D"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/uploads/2018/04/24/Jonathan_Wilson,_L.png?qua=
