<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;"><strong>By Jeff Rueter</strong></p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">After spending the weeks-long internationa=
l window training with Milan, <em><strong style=3D"color: #0077B6; font-sty=
le: normal; font-weight: 700;">Christian Pulisic</strong></em> started but =
struggled in a 1-1 draw against Sassuolo. His work rate was clear, but he f=
ailed to generate much threat. Only four of his last 22 Serie A appearances=
 =E2=80=93 most of them starts =E2=80=93 have seen him score or get an assi=
st. Now a veteran figure at 28, his lack of end product has left club and c=
ountry to weigh how he fits as both teams evolve around him.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">It=E2=80=99s far too soon to write Pulisic=
 off as a top-end contributor, but 28-year-old forwards lack an element of =
untapped promise. He covers considerable ground in all phases, an invaluabl=
e trait. His more decisive touches can generate threats =E2=80=93 he played=
 the pass before the assist on Milan=E2=80=99s sole goal on Sunday =E2=80=
=93 but he too often appears caught in two minds about his best course of a=
ction.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">After years of being cast by Milan and, es=
pecially, the US as an attacking focal point, he may be more dangerous as a=
n auxiliary option with a lower touch volume. That could be possible with t=
he national team, where <em><strong style=3D"color: #0077B6; font-style: no=
rmal; font-weight: 700;">Folarin Balogun</strong></em> is a proven goal thr=
eat and others =E2=80=93 like <em><strong style=3D"color: #0077B6; font-sty=
le: normal; font-weight: 700;">Gio Reyna</strong></em>, <em><strong style=
=3D"color: #0077B6; font-style: normal; font-weight: 700;">Malik Tillman</s=
trong></em>, and <em><strong style=3D"color: #0077B6; font-style: normal; f=
ont-weight: 700;">Cavan Sullivan</strong></em> =E2=80=93 are more natural c=
hance creators. Milan sound eager to sign Pulisic to fresh terms, too.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Until July, Pulisic=E2=80=99s entire caree=
r had been framed in the context of a home World Cup. But with that moment =
having passed and his performances leaving something to be desired, we=E2=
=80=99re left to wait and watch to see who Pulisic is, and will be, as a pl=
ayer.</p>
